# Framework working artifacts
docs/features/*/.last-verify.json
docs/features/*/reflect/*.context.md
docs/features/*/why/*.context.md
docs/features/*/arena/
docs/features/*/adversary/*.tmp
docs/features/*/security/*.tmp
docs/features/*/adversary/*.md
docs/features/*/adversary/*.attempt.json
docs/features/*/security/*.md
docs/features/*/security/*.attempt.json
# Raw cross-model transcripts and retry sidecars stay local. Sanitized,
# hash-only receipts are the clone-durable proof and remain tracked.
!docs/features/*/review-receipts/
!docs/features/*/review-receipts/*.json
# The receipt negation above must not re-include macOS AppleDouble metadata.
docs/features/*/review-receipts/._*.json
tools/visual-qa/reports/

# Test artifacts
playwright-report/
test-results/
cypress/screenshots/
cypress/videos/
